,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180422267,"data":"PROMPT:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180426942,"data":"Write a Python function using two pointers to check if a given string is a palindrome, ignoring non-alphanumeric characters.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180431763,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180436147,"data":"BASE MODEL RESPONSE:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180440918,"data":"To create a Python function that checks if a given string is a palindrome, ignoring non-alphanumeric characters, you can use the following approach:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180445589,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180449626,"data":"1. Convert the input string to lowercase.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180453784,"data":"2. Use two pointers to traverse the string from both ends towards the center.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180458026,"data":"3. Compare characters at these positions: left and right (or vice versa).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180462399,"data":"4. If all corresponding characters match, return `True`; otherwise, return `False`.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180468323,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180472351,"data":"Here's how you could implement this:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180476421,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180480368,"data":"```python\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180484387,"data":"def is_palindrome(s):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180488468,"data":"    \"\"\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180492549,"data":"    Check if the given string is a palindrome, ignoring non-alphanumeric characters.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180496876,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180518283,"data":"    :param s: The string to check.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180523144,"data":"    :return: True if the string is a palindrome, False otherwise.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180527727,"data":"    \"\"\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180532298,"data":"    # Remove non-alphanumeric characters and convert to lowercase\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180536557,"data":"    cleaned_s = ''.join(char.lower() for char in s if char.isalnum())\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180540705,"data":"    \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180544691,"data":"    # Initialize pointers\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180548699,"data":"    left, right = 0, len(cleaned_s) - 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180552883,"data":"    \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180557491,"data":"    while left \u003c right:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180563403,"data":"        # Move the left pointer until it points to a character that does not match\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180579062,"data":"        while left \u003c right and not cleaned_s[left].isalnum():\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180583334,"data":"            left += 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180587285,"data":"        # Move the right pointer until it points to a character that does not match\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180591334,"data":"        while left \u003c right and not cleaned_s[right].isalnum():\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180594829,"data":"            right -= 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180598025,"data":"        \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180601417,"data":"        # If characters do not match, the string is not a palindrome\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180604892,"data":"        if cleaned_s[left] != cleaned_s[right]:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180608184,"data":"            return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180611341,"data":"        \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180614861,"data":"        # Move both pointers towards the center\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180618321,"data":"        left += 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180621453,"data":"        right -= 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180625114,"data":"    \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180629231,"data":"    return True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180632276,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180635204,"data":"# Example usage:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180638461,"data":"input_string = \"A man, a plan, a canal: Panama\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.18064187,"data":"print(is_palindrome(input_string))  # Output: True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180645213,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180648181,"data":"input_string = \"race a car\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180653169,"data":"print(is_palindrome(input_string))  # Output: False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180657307,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180661075,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180664075,"data":"### Explanation:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180667397,"data":"- **Cleaning the String**: We first remove any non-alphanumeric characters by converting each character to lowercase and then joining them back into a single string.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":156.180671291,"data":"- **Two Pointers Approach**:\n"}
